# Product image corners

- Use an explicit 8px corner radius (`rounded-[8px]`) for rectangular product image frames in new and edited website experiences, including cart thumbnails, product cards, and product galleries.
- Apply the radius to the image frame with `overflow-hidden` so the image is clipped consistently.
- Preserve circular yarn swatches and other intentionally circular imagery.
- Apply this default going forward and when editing relevant image frames; do not broadly restyle unrelated pages unless requested.
- Example: cart thumbnail frames use `overflow-hidden rounded-[8px]` while preserving the photo's proportions.
